# Efficient agent

- One task per chat. Prefer pointed `@file` / `@folder` over repo-wide exploration.
- Read the mapped doc once; grep/glob for symbols instead of dumping large files.
- Implement in the owning package only. Touch `apps/bedeh_bestan` only for router / pubspec wiring.
- Do not paste or re-read generated slang output; edit `*_en.i18n.json` + `*_fa.i18n.json`, then `melos run translations`.
- Prefer shell/melos for analyze, test, format — not long agent loops “until green”.
- Stop and ask when the next step needs a product decision; do not invent scope.
- When done: short summary (files touched + how to verify). No essay.
